    "description": "LOKZ-1 Frame (OK Zoomer): Laffs Dynamics\n\nVariant of the OK Zoomer pistol frame, a 3DP version of the Ruger SR45. \n\nRestyled variant with ridging down the grip backstrap, added text to the pistol dust cover, and a restructured picatinny rail.\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C\nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Perimeters: 8+ \nInfill: 80%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\n\n\nNotes: \n\nThis file pack is for the frame only. Other printed part files will need to be downloaded from the base design release; \nlinks provided in the below text.\n\n\n\nBase OK Zoomer pistol frame files can be found on Odysee: \n\nOdysee: https://odysee.com/@TheGatalog-PrintableFramesReceivers:9/OK-ZOOMER:b\n\n(Other print settings and the hardware list will be provided in the base data pack)\n\n\n\nAccreditations:\n\nGhostgunsrspooky & Uberclay: Creators of the OK Zoomer pistol frame; used the base frame model from their design release.",
